  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Silver Bar.png|200px|left|Silver bar]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |level = 24\n |price = 1 to 147\n |time = 8 h\n |xp = 18\n |upgrades = {{Infoicon|ptrain|big|link=Personal Train}}\n |source = {{Infoicon|smelter|bigger|link=Smelter}}\n |base = 41\n |dia = 9\n |time3 = 6 h 48 min\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n}}\n'''Silver bars''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 24.\n\nSilver bars are used to make [[Jeweler|jewelry]], and to upgrade the [[Personal Train|personal train]] in the player's [[town]].\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making silver bars'''===\n[[File:Smelter.png|150px|left|Smelter]]\nSilver bars are made in the [[Smelter]].\n\nTo make a silver bar, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Silver Ore.png|75px|Silver ore|link=Silver Ore]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 8 hours to make one bar, and 6 hours 48 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] smelter. Each bar gives players 18 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling silver bars'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Silver bars can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 1,476 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bars.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a bar costs 54 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Using silver bars'''===\nSilver bars are used to make the following [[products]]:\n\n{{Item Usage|Silver Bar\n|Bracelet|2|38\n|Necklace|2|39\n|Iron Bracelet|1|41\n}}\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* As is the case for all Smelter products, completing a [[truck]] order requesting one or more bars rewards players with a random [[voucher]].\n* [[Boat]] orders never ask for silver bars\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Silberbarren\n|es = Lingote de plata\n|fr = Lingot d'Argent\n|it = Lingotto d'argento\n|nl = Zilverstaaf\n|no = Sølvbarre\n|ru = Слиток серебра\n|zh = Silver Bar\n}}\n[[pt-br:Barra de prata]]\n\n[[Category:Smelter Products]]\n[[Category:Silver Ore Products]]",
